  "HubSpot is an integrated customer platform that empowers scaling businesses to provide exceptional customer experiences. It offers a cohesive solution, combining powerful tools that work seamlessly together. With HubSpot, the focus is on prioritizing customers, ensuring easy customization, and fostering team collaboration through its Smart CRM. Ultimately, HubSpot helps businesses create delightful customer interactions.": "HubSpot は、規模を拡大する企業が優れた顧客エクスペリエンスを提供できるようにする統合顧客プラットフォームです。",
